Find **balanceOf**, click the arrow on the right to expand it. Paste your wallet address, click **Query**. Copy the number exactly as shown.
{% endstep %}

{% step %}
**Redeem**

Open [Exchange → Write as Proxy](https://arbiscan.io/address/0x8b80Da76AAb8798Fd537A9A83f462CDA69eC1EE4#writeProxyContract).

Click **Connect Wallet** and connect your wallet.

Find **redeem**, click the arrow on the right to expand it. Fill in:

* `_asset`: `0xFd086bC7CD5C481DCC9C85ebE478A1C0b69FCbb9` (USDT)
