{% endstep %}
{% endstepper %}

### If the transaction fails

| Error message                          | What it means                                       | What to do                                                               |
| -------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `Only asset available for redeem`      | Wrong `_asset` address                              | Copy the `_asset` address from the instructions for your token and chain |
| `Not enough tokens to redeem`          | `_amount` is bigger than your balance               | Copy the number from **balanceOf** again                                 |
| `Only once in block`                   | Someone else redeemed in the same block             | Try again in a few seconds                                               |
| `Not enough for transfer redeemAmount` | Not enough free liquidity in the contract right now | Try a smaller amount, or try again later                                 |
